WEBVTT

00:05:57.518 --> 00:06:01.079
on what I was certain would be
my long, long life.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:06.371
As is this case with many of us,
it's a mindset that served me well.

00:06:07.024 --> 00:06:10.146
The gospel of success drove me to achieve,

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.740
to dream big,

00:06:11.764 --> 00:06:13.213
to abandon fear.

00:06:14.183 --> 00:06:16.655
It was a mindset that served me well

00:06:16.679 --> 00:06:18.252
until it didn't,

00:06:18.276 --> 00:06:22.237
until I was confronted with something
I couldn't manage my way out of;

00:06:23.078 --> 00:06:25.720
until I found myself
saying into the phone,

00:06:25.744 --> 00:06:27.273
"But I have a son,"

00:06:27.776 --> 00:06:30.792
because it was all
I could think of to say.